@title EMC-05: shield pigtail impedance is computed from the wire (no 1 nH per mm rule)
@area Check
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The shields fixture has a 60 mm pigtail: 2e-7 * 0.06 * (ln(120) - 1) = 45.4 nH, 2.9 ohm at 10 MHz.
open qa/fixtures/emc-cabinet-shields.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc check
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
expect "EMC-05"
scroll 360 400 -450
wait 10
expect "computed from a 2 mm wire"
shot 01-pigtail-impedance
check_layout
